    specs: `CLAUDE.md 'The repo root is closed' rule and the Screenshots section, the audit-1 root-docs-assets report docs/audit-fix/2026-08-25-refactor-audit-1/work/agents/root-docs-assets.md and the phase 1b fix log (what left the root, what was refused), the memory that five root entries left on c8d0e87.`,
    leads: `raw/tracked-bytes-by-dir.txt, raw/largest-tracked-bytes.txt, raw/tracked-files.txt, raw/largest-files.txt; git log --diff-filter=A --name-only --since=2026-08-27 -- public e2e/__screenshots__ .claude (what was added since audit 1).`,
    questions: `For each root entry: stay/move/delete/owner, with the tool that requires it? What is progress.md's growth per week and what would the archive rule look like concretely? Which public/ files does nothing reference (cross-check with the dead-code lens by naming them)? What do the imported skill packs weigh today and does anything in the repo reference them by path (CLAUDE.md rows)? How many .DS_Store files are in the tree?`,
